  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Replaces your melee ability with a 2-hit combo blade attack. Each stab deals <pve 543 /> <pvp [84] /> damage and has an extended lunge range of 7 meters.\n\nScales with the Melee Stat and Melee-Damage Buffs. Despite its behavior, this is not considered a \"Glaive Melee\".",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-21T18:51:12.078Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
  "compendium": {
    "gid": "441434520",
    "rowKey": "Cull's Shadow\n\nSoulburn\nSoulforge\nBlades of Unmaking\n↑Selectable Trait",
    "section": "Kinetic Slot Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Kinetic Aggressive Fusion Rifle\nCounts as a Weapon of Sorrow. \nThe last Exotic Weapon added to Destiny 2.\n\nReplaces Melee Ability with the weapon's Frontal Blades capable of performing a swift two-hit combo with an extended 7 meter lunge.\nEach strike deals ? [84] Kinetic Damage. Frontal Blades deal 50% increased Melee Damage on Corrupted Enemies.\nFrontal Blade Damage scales with Melee Stat and Melee Damage Buffs. It is NOT a Glaive Melee.\n\nUpon scoring 2 Frontal Blade Strikes within 2? seconds of each or a Frontal Blade Kill:\nGrants a stack of Soulfire Charges, up to a maximum of 6 stacks and restores 40 HP.\nStacks are only consumed upon firing or on death.\n\nFires an increasingly wider 3 round burst of 4 projectiles each.\nProjectiles deal 143 [?] Kinetic Damage.\nConsumes a stack of Soulfire Charge to inflict Potent Corruption on enemies.\nPotent Corruption deals 65 [?] Kinetic Damage every 0.5 seconds, ramping up by ~8.7% per tick over 20 ticks, up to a final tick of 300 [?] Damage, totalling 2,985 [?] Damage.\n\nSoulfire Charge's Potent Corruption causes enemies to create a Soulfire Crystal on death.\n\nSoulfire Crystals are Constructs with 350 HP that linger for 15 seconds, exploding upon being reduced to 0 HP.\nSoulfire Crystal Explosion deals up to 1,065 [?] Kinetic Damage over 8 meters, down to 75% Damage.\n\n↑Catalyst grants 4 selectable traits:\nSoulfire Succor | Destroying Soulfire Crystals with Frontal Blades grants a Soulfire Charge and refills +1 Ammo.\n\nSoulfire Rancor | Soulfire Crystals explode when an enemy is within 7 meters, dealing 5% increased damage and inflicting the aforementioned Potent Corruption.\n\nSoulfire Zeal | Soulfire Crystal Explosions within 15 meters grant maximized movement speed and 20?% Damage Resist for +7 seconds, up to 20 seconds.\n\nSoulfire Skewer | Soulfire Crystal Explosions within 15 meters grant Frontal Blades the ability to inflict Corruption for +7 seconds, up to 20 seconds.\nCorruption deals 16 per tick every 0.5 seconds up to 10 times per infliction and can stack.",
      "runs": [
